  "description": {
    "en": "A curated list, searchable directory, and machine-readable index of Native Shell (nsh) modules (nshm), framework crates, templates, and guides.",
    "zh": "Native Shell（nsh）模块（nshm）、框架 crate、模板示例与文档教程的精选清单、可搜索目录与机器可读索引。"
  },
  "repository": "https://github.com/AkaraChen/nsh-awesome",
  "siteUrl": "https://nsh-awesome.vercel.app/",
