        "zh": "基于原生 `<Canvas>` 的交互式网络图谱组件，内置力导向、分层、环形与网格布局，并支持可选的 Rust 加速后端。"
      },
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/JetSquirrel/nsh-graph",
      "cratesUrl": "https://crates.io/crates/nsh-graph",
      "homepage": "https://jetsquirrel.github.io/nsh-graph/",
      "platforms": ["iOS", "Android", "macOS", "Windows", "Linux", "GPUI", "Web"],
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-25",
      "notes": {
        "en": "Includes community collapsing, PNG export via `OffscreenCanvas`, and color-blind-safe palettes.",
        "zh": "支持社区折叠、通过 `OffscreenCanvas` 导出 PNG 与色盲友好配色方案。"
      }
    },
